{
  "changelog": "Initial release of guaikei-xiaohongshu-data-collector:\n\n- Provides structured JSON access to public XiaoHongShu (\u5c0f\u7ea2\u4e66) note data\u2014likes, comments, favorites, note details, and creator posts\u2014without requiring login.\n- Supports searching notes by keyword, fetching individual note details and comments, and monitoring creator posts using command-line scripts.\n- Includes robust input checks, link type detection, and detailed routing based on user intent (keywords, note links, or profile links).\n- Handles errors with clear output structure and status codes, including FAQ for common issues.\n- Requires GUAIKEI_API_TOKEN environment variable for API access.\n- Logs each data request for easy reference and follow-up analysis.",
